    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.poster.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.webm?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.mp4?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A great adventure awaits you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to distant lands with a mission to save a magical academy and return the stolen heart of magic. Explore various locations, look for secrets, collect jewels and defeat enemies. Along the way, you will encounter challenges, puzzles and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.poster.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.webm?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.mp4?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find or take from enemies various hats with different effects. Find or buy various magic wands with different types of attacks and summoning animal allies. Collect all the pieces of the puzzle and fight the final boss - the thief of the heart of magic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/6e78fc2062b6699ede1929987ec64eee.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 completely different locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of enemies and 4 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 hats that give different special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of magic wands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many secret places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aesthetics of graphics and music from 8-16-bit consoles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.poster.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.webm?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/d7a9caddc4b189462876cb00c033cc6b.mp4?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A great adventure awaits you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to distant lands with a mission to save a magical academy and return the stolen heart of magic. Explore various locations, look for secrets, collect jewels and defeat enemies. Along the way, you will encounter challenges, puzzles and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.poster.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.webm?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/3ed59b64679c96982f227c7157a089f5.mp4?t=1752650088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find or take from enemies various hats with different effects. Find or buy various magic wands with different types of attacks and summoning animal allies. Collect all the pieces of the puzzle and fight the final boss - the thief of the heart of magic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667080/extras/6e78fc2062b6699ede1929987ec64eee.avif?t=1752650088\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 completely different locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of enemies and 4 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 hats that give different special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of magic wands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many secret places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aesthetics of graphics and music from 8-16-bit consoles</p></li></ul>",
